ffice environments. Built with a high-strength welded steel shell and lightweight cementitious core, this raised floor panel delivers exceptional load-bearing performance, fire resistance, and long-term durability.</div><div><br></div><div>Designed to support heavy IT equipment while providing efficient underfloor cable management and airflow distribution, the ATFLOR Cement Core Raised Floor Panel is the ideal choice for businesses seeking reliable and professional raised flooring systems. Available with High Pressure Laminate (HPL), anti-static PVC, or bare steel finishes, it meets the demanding requirements of mission-critical environments.</div><div><br></div><div>OTECH BD supplies genuine ATFLOR raised floor panels in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, professional consultation, and dependable after-sales support.</div><div><br></div><h3>Key Features</h3><div><br></div><ul><li>Heavy-duty cement core raised floor panel</li><li>Strong welded steel top and bottom sheets</li><li>Epoxy powder-coated finish for corrosion resistance</li><li>Excellent load-bearing capacity for IT infrastructure</li><li>Fire-resistant cementitious core construction</li><li>Supports underfloor cable management and cooling systems</li><li>Compatible with HPL, anti-static PVC, and bare finishes</li><li>Easy installation, maintenance, and panel replacement</li><li>Ideal for data centers, server rooms, and control rooms</li><li>Manufactured to international quality standards</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-